  "description": "One erased customer subject (backlog:d271d723, GDPR validazione B6): which contact or company was erased, why the titolare confirmed it, who decided and when, and what the erasure covered. Append-only accountability: rows are never updated or deleted, and a second erasure of the same subject replays the stored row. The row carries no personal data beyond the opaque subject id — no name, no email, no phone — so the registry itself never becomes a copy of what was erased.",
